#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0462 expect=noViolation domain=EC
#note "ECDOSTXT is not in the dataset, but no row qualifies: row 1 is excepted by ECOCCUR=N, row 2 carries a populated ECDOSE. The sister fires only where its parent CDISC-CG0462 would have fired (R-4.11c), so a dataset whose records all carry a dose or a non-occurrence stays silent."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset EC class=INTERVENTIONS label="Exposure as Collected"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col ECSEQ   type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col ECTRT   type=Char label="Name of Treatment"
col ECOCCUR type=Char label="Occurrence"
col ECDOSE  type=Num  label="Dose"
---
S1 | EC | 001 | 1 | DRUG A | N | .
S1 | EC | 001 | 2 | DRUG A | Y | 5
